 "topic": "Unlock hurricanes: hidden side mission 'Retest Freddie's Defenses' at Freddie's bunker (north side of Lake Leonida); break in once, he says come back after he upgrades his defenses; wait a few in-game days for his text; the second visit has mines by the intercom and drone waves; a hurricane alert then hits his TV; stay or leave, hurricanes are unlocked",
