 "summary": "GTA 6 has hurricanes, but they're locked. Find Freddie's bunker on the north side of Lake Leonida and break in once: Freddie says come back after he upgrades his defenses. Wait a few days for his text, then go back: this time there are mines by the intercom and waves of drones. Survive, and a hurricane alert hits his TV. Stay or leave, it doesn't matter: hurricanes can now hit Leonida.",
